( soak cycle for the burn-in machine: X only, within +-300 mm,      )
( up to the machine limits 500 mm/s and 1000 mm/s^2; about 35 s.   )
G21 G90 G17 G64
G0 X0
G4 P0.5
( long rapids, both directions )
G0 X300
G0 X-300
G0 X0
( feeds from creep to full speed )
G1 X20 F120
G1 X0 F600
G1 X100 F3000
G1 X-100 F12000
G1 X200 F30000
G1 X0 F30000
( short moves and reversals )
o100 repeat [20]
  G1 X5 F12000
  G1 X0
o100 endrepeat
( tiny steps, then hold )
o110 repeat [10]
  G1 X0.05 F300
  G1 X0
o110 endrepeat
G4 P1
( blended zig-zag through the planner )
G1 X50 F18000
G1 X10
G1 X80
G1 X-40
G1 X0
G4 P0.5
M2
